# Generated files: GitHub collapses their diffs in pull requests and leaves them
# out of the language statistics. Review their sources instead.
# docs/diagrams/*.svg: `make diagrams` renders them from docs/diagrams/*.mmd.
# /README.md: `make document` writes it from docs/USAGE.md and docs/DEVELOPMENT.md.
# The leading slash keeps the hand-written roles/*/README.md and molecule/README.md out.
docs/diagrams/*.svg linguist-generated=true
/README.md linguist-generated=true
